Navigation note: the web route /weekly-digest is single-segment, so AppRouteParser resolves it directly via the new
route's pathSegment ("weekly-digest") — no alias needed (cf. the sibling .fleetCompare). The page is reachable from
the Insights sidebar group, the iPhone "More" tab, the command palette, and as a deep link.

SI / units note (frontend-si-cutover + ADR-005): every model value is SI canonical (meters, watt-hours, watts,
seconds, °C). Distance/energy/power/duration are converted to the user's preference ONLY at the SwiftUI render
boundary via the shared KMP Units facade (Units.formatDistance/formatEnergy/formatPower/formatDuration/convertDistance
/convertEnergy) driven by @Environment(\.tsUnits). The web's hardcoded "(km)"/"(kWh)" chart-title units are replaced
by the live unit symbol so imperial users see mi/kWh — the architecturally-correct SI behavior, not a regression.

